<title>USA: Comcast finalises acquisition of E!.</title>
<headline>Comcast finalises acquisition of E!.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-04-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Comcast Corp said on Tuesday that Comcast Entertainment Holdings LLC had completed the acquisition of a majority interest in E! Entertainment Television from Time Warner.</p>
<p>The company had announced its intention to acquire a majority stake in E!, a cable network with more than 42 million subscribers, on January 28 through a joint venture known as Comcast Entertainment Holdings LLC with Walt Disney Co.</p>
<p>The company said E! Entertainment Television will be managed by its programming partnership, C3 (Comcast Content &amp; Communication).</p>
<p>Comcast is the principal owner of QVC, an electronic retailer.</p>
</text>
